        "original_id": "99d8097d-bbff-5acc-b918-30efc1fc5789",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Cameron, Michael McIntyre, Alesha Dixon, David Walliams, David Hasselhoff\n- Roles: comedians, actor, presenter, judges\n- Organizations/Shows: Britain's Got Talent (series 6)\n\nFacts:\n- Ray Cameron was born as Thomas Cameron McIntyre on 19 April 1936 and died on 27 December 1993.\n- Ray Cameron was a Canadian comedian and the father of British comedian Michael McIntyre.\n- Michael Hazen James McIntyre was born on 21 February 1976.\n- Michael McIntyre is an English comedian, actor, and presenter.\n- In Britain's Got Talent series 6, Alesha Dixon and David Walliams joined the judging panel.\n- In Britain's Got Talent series 6, Alesha Dixon and David Walliams replaced Michael McIntyre and David Hasselhoff on the judging panel.",
